## Setup

{{^REPO}}
In a project made with `npm create @agentapps`, the CLI is the `@agentapps/cli` devDependency:
run it as `npx @agentapps/cli`. Elsewhere install it with `npm i -g @agentapps/cli` (never the
unscoped `agentapps` package, which is unrelated). To try the app without touching your global
agentapps setup, use a scratch config as the create-agent-app skill's `live-testing.md` shows.

{{/REPO}}
```bash
agentapps install {{APP_ID}} {{ID}}
{{CONFIG_LINES}}
agentapps {{ID}} tools
agentapps {{ID}} tool <tool-name> key:value        # TODO: a real example call
```

